,"thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362411/screencap/68ff289b6ce21.jpg"},{"title":"The Machine That Shouted Love at the End of the World","synopsis":"Love is a complicated emotion. As Akira and Yugure go on a date, Amoru must wrestle with her jealousy.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362412/screencap/6908711fad5c3.jpg"},{"title":"Paper Songs of a Budding Primate","synopsis":"Amoru's desperate search for her parent's banned storybooks leads her and Akira to a secured library.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362413/screencap/6911dba9b3cd3.jpg"},{"title":"To the Ocean Horizon Descends a Treacherous Swallow","synopsis":"Akira's group hide from OWEL after escaping the library.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362414/screencap/691ad89a73d81.jpg"},{"title":"Overlooking the Expanse of Days Past","synopsis":"They say true love conquers all, but sometimes, even love isn't enough. Especially when secrets and lies threaten to tear people apart.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362415/screencap/6924173557f9f.jpg"},{"title":"His and Her Long Afternoon","synopsis":"A single act of violence shattered Akira and Towasa's lives in the distant past, yet time marches on. What happened after that fateful day of the shooting?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362416/screencap/69300e081fe78.jpg"},{"title":"\"Don`t Cry,\" She Said","synopsis":"Amaru wants to be with Akira and Yugure, but circumstances make that an impossibility. But what if there was a way to make her wish come true?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362417/screencap/693695a86ead2.jpg"},{"title":"Your Love Belongs to You","synopsis":"Love is as messy as it is transformative. It can drive people to selfish extremes just as much as it can drive them to heroic sacrifice. In the end, what does love mean to Akira and Yugure?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11362418/screencap/6942829102102.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
